# vis10 roster-colour: synthetic save DKSAVE0-unlist0 (record 0, Gretchen, left at another place: not listed), the Gasthaus roster as in roster-figure (Gunther retires): rows 0..3 = Gunther, Hans, +Ebhard, +Albrecht = records 1..4 (party Albrecht 4, Ebhard 3, Hans 2): the colour keys act on the slot whose id equals the ROW number (key 1 on Ebhard's row 2 changes Hans's colours, on Albrecht's row 3 Ebhard's, on Hans's row 1 nobody's); the pointer, left by the last option click at (76, 76), stays there through arrows and colour keys (DS:6EEC / DS:6EEE unchanged) (the user's report of a pointer at the top-left: not the original's). Rows 0..3 only (row 4 with slot 0's id 4 ends the original: pics\small.pic)
